  "inspection": {
    "ima": "Fresh official homepage links September2026 edition. PDF definitions1, caysichite39 and kuliokite118 viewed. Caysichite Rn1987 s.p. is a renaming event, not minted approval CURIE; kuliokite A1984-064 verified.",
    "caysichite1974": "All6 pages read and visually checked, Tables1–3/Figures1–6. Separate colourless and mixed yellow specimens; water Penfield/CO2 determinations; TGA air12°C/min, DTA CO2 10°C/min, static sequential heating. No gas identification/product chemistry/recovery mass balance.",
    "caysichite1978": "All8 pages read and visually checked, Tables1–5/Figures1–5. Hogarth specimen, Ccm21 refinement R0.06/959 observed reflections, no located H; site and hydrogen occupancy interpretations. Historical CISTI structure-factor deposit not acquired.",
    "caysichite2025": "All16 pages read, all page contact sheets inspected; Tables1–6 and Figures1–6 examined with text. New Ploskaya specimens distinct from Canadian material; SEM-EDS with five to ten spots per analysis, calculated structural water. Table5 site occupancies explicitly plausible hypotheses, H not located. No CIF acquired.",
    "kuliokite2025": "All16 pages read and visually checked; Methods2.1–2.3, Tables1–5 and Figures1–9. Three crystals/4–7 spots each; WDS20kV20–30nA5µm.293(2)K Im refinement, Y/Yb proxies, oneH located, F3 ratio fixed. Cited1986/1993 papers not independently acquired. No CIF acquired.",
    "visual_artifacts": "All primary pages rendered to <source-stem>-renders/page-NN.png and four-page contact sheets in the raw root; IMA pages1/39/118 rendered. No independent re-refinement or complete numerical structure-factor transcription performed."
  },
  "conflicts_and_limits": {
    "caysichite": [
      "1974 thermal body: rounded stages8.3+10.6+5.3=24.2%, but reportedtotal24.3%; preserve as source precision discrepancy, no invented corrected number.",
